notes.content:
[list]
[*]Add horizontal and vertical view reversal control to the 'Game Settings';
[*]Add view movement  speed control to 'game settings';
[/list]

首个关卡内容调整，指引更直观；
大部分教程内容更改为非必须完成项，可根据需要是否立即去下一个关卡；
---------------------------------------------------
Adjust some contents of the first level ,making guidance more intuitive ;
Most of the tutorial content has been changed to non mandatory items, you can go to the next level as wish;

[list]
[*]Add and adjust some striking sound effects;
[*]Replace the flying sound effect of the Nimbus Cloud , more joyful;
[*]Change the animation of wukong info, more handsome;
[*]Optimize jumping sound effects;
[*]Optimize open world roles and improve performance;
[*]Fix the issue of individual objects turning black in color;
[*]DLSS3 and FSR3 have been updated to the latest version;
[*]Other minor optimizations;
[/list]

[list]
[*]Comprehensive refactoring  of scene destruction, significantly improving performance, allowing BOSS battles to enjoy a thorough destruction experience;
[*]The details of the Great Sage Armor have been adjusted , more handsome;
[*]Adjust the damage assessment of some of the Great Sage's attacks to be more accurate;
[*]Adjust some open world scene details;
[*]Adjust the game opening animation;
[/list]

提高舞棍技能的攻击速度；
变身后添加背景音乐；
新增个别汉字的英文翻译；
调整黑熊精的闪避距离；
优化龙王的碰撞；
细节调整；
Improve the attack speed of the dance stick skill;
Add background music after transformation;
Add English translations for some Chinese characters;
Adjust the evasion distance of the Black Bear Spirit;
Optimize the collision of the Chinese Dragon ;
Detail adjustment;

修复极端情况出现的无法弹出死亡菜单的bug；
性能优化；
小细节调整；
Fix the bug where the death menu cannot pop up in extreme situations;
Performance optimization;
Minor adjustments to details;

金箍棒远程与蓄力攻击手柄键调整为LT；
提高变身技能获取概率;
Adjust the remote and charging attack gamepad key to LT;
Improve the probability of acquiring transformation skills;

延长变身时间；
"锁定敌人"可使用鼠标中键；
Extend transformation time;
'Lock target' can be done using the middle mouse button;

完美闪避后瞬移攻击可令所有敌人漏出破绽，增加眩晕伤害；
蓄力金箍棒技能开场可用，降低斗气消耗，可击倒所有敌人；
降低跳棍蓄力下劈技能学习等级；
增加筋斗云飞行技能，可在地图上随意飞行；

Teleportation attacks after perfect dodging can make all enemies leak and increase stun damage; 
The 'Enhanced wishful stick' skill can be used in the opening, reducing the cost of Qi, and can knock down all enemies; 
Lower the learning level of the skill of the 'super jumping stick attack';
add new 'Somersault cloud flight' skill, you can fly on the map at will;

毫毛分身增加新技能；
优化BOSS战的稳定性；
性能优化；
New abilities added by Millihair doppelganger; 
Improved stability in BOSS battles; 
Performance optimization;

筋斗云飞行关卡按键调整，防止按错；
场景性能优化；
Fly Map key ajustment;
scene performance optimization;
